  "disputed": {
    "right_stick": "One source (hollowknight.wiki) lists a right-stick click as the default 'Challenge' input on Xbox controller; another source (Destructoid) explicitly states the Challenge action is not available/bound by default on Xbox. Could not confirm which is correct, so left out of controls.",
    "dpad_W": "Some sources state the D-pad works as an alternate movement input alongside the left stick by default, but none gave exact per-direction confirmation, so D-pad bindings were omitted rather than guessed.",
    "dpad_E": "Same uncertainty as dpad_W regarding D-pad as alternate movement on Xbox controller."
  },
  "source": {
    "url": "https://hollowknight.wiki/w/Controls_(Silksong)",
    "note": "Cross-checked against hollowknightsilksong.wiki.fextralife.com/Controls, destructoid.com control guide, and shacknews.com control guide. All four independently agreed on Right Bumper = Skill/Tool and Right Trigger = Sprint (one outlier source, game8.co, had these reversed and was treated as an error). Keyboard bindings were consistent across all sources checked."
